Week 7: Computer Vision with CNNs
📋 Learning Objectives
By the end of this week, you will be able to:

✅ Understand convolutional neural network architecture

✅ Implement CNNs from scratch and with Keras

✅ Master transfer learning with pre-trained models

✅ Build image classification systems

✅ Implement object detection with YOLO and SSD

✅ Perform image segmentation with U-Net

✅ Use data augmentation to improve performance

✅ Deploy computer vision models to production

